To make a release the following need to be updated in sa/adv directory depending on the release:

version_a6n2.cpp
1) SW_PART_NUMBER
2) SW_CHANGE_LEVEL
3) SW_REL_DATE
4) Uncomment appropriate build type, for example #define SW_BUILD "T01" for Test release
5) Define the appropriate FlashComponentIdentifier. Wheel Loader vs Track Type Loader

appVeritySettings.sh
1) Set the BUILD_ID accordingly
      Test Release: "T0x"
      Dev Release:  "D0x"
      Concept/Production Release: "0"
2) Set the SOFTWARE_PNUM
3) Set the CHANGE_LEVEL
